[#Menu: Gateway of Tally]
    Add : Item : Before : @@LocalPriceListIniItem : Ask Algo AI

[Menu: Ask Algo AI]
    Add : Item : Ask about ledgers : Call : AlgoAI Ask Ledgers

[Function: AlgoAI Ask Ledgers]
    ; Sends the current company name to the local bridge server
    ; (src/cli.ts / algo-tally-bridge, expected on http://localhost:4600 —
    ; see ../README.md for how to run it) and shows the reply in a
    ; simple message box. TDL's own HTTP Post action is a real, built-in
    ; capability since Tally.ERP 9 Series 6.x — this is not a
    ; third-party plugin mechanism, it's Tally calling out on its own.
    00 : HTTP Post  : "http://localhost:4600/analyze-ledgers" : $$AlgoAIRequestBody : $$AlgoAIReplyText : "application/json"
    10 : Log        : $$AlgoAIReplyText
    20 : Message Box : $$AlgoAIReplyText

[System: Formula]
    AlgoAIRequestBody : "{""companyName"":""" + $$CurrentCompany + """,""question"":""Summarize the ledgers with the largest negative closing balances and flag anything unusual.""}"
